#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:7
msgid "Conductor type"
msgstr "导体类型"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:10
msgid "Multiline conductor"
msgstr "多线导体"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:12
msgid ""
"For `multiline conductors`_, QElectroTech allows defining many different "
"parameters from the conductor. The parameters which can be defined are:"
msgstr ""
"对于 `多线导体 <multiline conductors_>`_ ，QElectroTech 允许定义许多不同的导体参数。可定义的参数包括："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:15
msgid "Display parameters:"
msgstr "显示参数："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:17
msgid "**Text size**: Size of the displayed text."
msgstr "**文本大小** ：所显示文本的大小。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Text formula**: To be used if a variable value is desired at the **Text** "
"field during `conductor creation`_."
msgstr ""
"**文本公式** ：如果希望在 `导体创建 <conductor creation_>`_ 过程中在 **文本** 字段使用变量值，则使用此项。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:19
msgid "**Text**: Text field content to be displayed at `folio`_."
msgstr "**文本** ：要在 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 上显示的文本字段内容。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:20
msgid "**Text color**: Font color to be displayed at `folio`_."
msgstr "**文本颜色** ：要在 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 上显示的字体颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:21
msgid ""
"Positioning and orientation from the displayed text at `folio`_, vertical "
"and horizontal `conductors`_."
msgstr "`图幅 <folio_>`_ 上纵向和横向 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 中显示文本的定位和方向。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:23
msgid "Conductor properties:"
msgstr "导体属性："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Function**: Variable from `conductor`_, it is used to define the wire "
"phase (L1, L2, L3, N, etc.)."
msgstr "**功能** ：来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的变量，用于定义导线相位（L1、L2、L3、N 等）。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Voltage / Protocol**: Variable from the `conductor`_, it is used to define"
" the wire voltage (0v,230V,400V, 6kV, etc.) or the wires network protocol "
"(IP)."
msgstr ""
"**电压/协议** ：来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的变量，用于定义导线电压（0V、230V、400V、6kV "
"等）或导线网络协议（IP）。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Conductor color**: Variable from the `conductor`_, it is used to define "
"the wire color."
msgstr "**导体颜色** ：来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的变量，用于定义导线颜色。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Conductor section**: Variable from the `conductor`_, it is used to define "
"the wire section."
msgstr "**导体截面积** ：来自 `导体 <conductor_>`_ 的变量，用于定义导线截面积。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:29
msgid "**Cable**:"
msgstr "**电缆**："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:30
msgid "**Bus**:"
msgstr "**总线**："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:35
msgid "Figure: Multiline conductor properties"
msgstr "图：多线导体属性"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:39
msgid ""
"Displaying the `conductor TAG (code)`_ at `multiline diagrams`_ is usual for"
" an easily manage of the manufacturing, erection, commissioning and "
"maintenance phase of the product."
msgstr ""
"在 `多线图 <multiline diagrams_>`_ 中显示 `导体 TAG （代码） <conductor TAG (code)_>`_ "
"是产品制造、安装、调试和维护阶段便于管理的常见做法。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:42
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows an automatic conductor number definition for the text "
"using the variable ``%autonum`` at the **Text formula** field. This field "
"have to be defined at `Folio properties`_ before starting the `conductor "
"creation`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在 **文本公式** 字段中使用变量 ``%autonum`` 为文本自动定义导体编号。开始 `导体创建 "
"<conductor creation_>`_ 之前，必须在 `图幅属性 <Folio properties_>`_ 中定义此字段。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:47
msgid "Single line conductor"
msgstr "单线导体"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:49
msgid ""
"For `single line conductors`_, the `conductors`_ are represented without any"
" text information. Only the type of power system should be defined to have "
"the correct symbol representation."
msgstr ""
"对于 `单线导体 <single line conductors_>`_ ，`导体 <conductors_>`_ "
"的表示不包含任何文本信息。只需定义电力系统的类型，即可获得正确的符号表示。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:52
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows the following options for `single line conductors`_:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 为 `单线导体 <single line conductors_>`_ 提供以下选项："

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:54
msgid "System with or without **Ground**"
msgstr "系统带或不带 **接地**"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:55
msgid "System with or without **Neutral**"
msgstr "系统带或不带 **中性线**"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:56
msgid ""
"**PEN** system, system where **Neutral** and **Ground** are the same wire."
msgstr "**PEN** 系统，即 **中性线** 和 **接地** 为同一根导线的系统。"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:57
msgid "Systems with one, two or three phases"
msgstr "具有一相、两相或三相的系统"

#: ../../source/users/conductor/properties/conductor_type.rst:62
msgid "Figure: Single line conductor properties"
msgstr "图：单线导体属性"
